const soundNames={rain:'窗边轻雨',forest:'林间鸟鸣',waves:'远岸海浪',cafe:'溪畔流水'},soundIcons={rain:'rain',forest:'tree',waves:'waves',cafe:'waves'};
const soundSources={rain:'assets/ambience/rain.mp3',forest:'assets/ambience/forest.mp3',waves:'assets/ambience/waves.mp3',cafe:'assets/ambience/stream.mp3'};
